713
01:05:36,389 --> 01:05:39,183
Where the hell's Barclay?
Whitehurst!

714
01:05:41,811 --> 01:05:45,230
Colonel Shelton, you'd better
have a look in here, sir.

715
01:05:48,985 --> 01:05:50,694
